  "name": "loss_rank_gap_tanh_advantage_repaired",
  "intuition": "Penalize positive rank gaps weighted by the tanh of advantage difference, ensuring gradients flow via log_prob differences.",
  "pseudocode": "adv_diff = advantage_w - advantage_l\nrank_penalty = relu(delta_rank)\nscaled_penalty = rank_penalty * tanh(adv_diff)\nlog_prob_diff = log_prob_w - log_prob_l\nloss_per_pair = -logsigmoid(log_prob_diff) * scaled_penalty * weight\nloss = mean(loss_per_pair)",
